WEBVTT

00:21:59.156 --> 00:22:02.236
What's your thinking about the return
of the nuclear threat?

00:22:02.276 --> 00:22:04.436
YNH: It's extremely frightening.

00:22:04.996 --> 00:22:06.956
You know, it's like it's almost Freudian,

00:22:06.996 --> 00:22:08.836
it's the return of the repressed.

00:22:09.276 --> 00:22:11.316
We thought that, oh, nuclear weapons, yes,

00:22:11.316 --> 00:22:13.356
there was something
about that in the 1960s

00:22:13.356 --> 00:22:16.156
with the Cuban Missile Crisis
and Dr. Strangelove.

00:22:16.796 --> 00:22:20.236
But no, it's here.

00:22:20.236 --> 00:22:22.996
And, you know, it took just a few days

00:22:22.996 --> 00:22:26.676
of difficulties on the battlefield

00:22:26.716 --> 00:22:27.876
for suddenly --

00:22:27.916 --> 00:22:31.756
I mean, I'm watching
television, like, the news